'''Hikaru Saotome''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] implemented in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]] and was obtainable during the [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]. He could be unlocked by using a [[Serial Codes|serial code]] from "Kishidan's CD (幸せにしかしねーから)", which is no longer possible due to serial codes being removed.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 163
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Hikaru Saotome
|name2 = Hikaru & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Hikaru & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Hikaru is virtually a weaker [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Kung Fu Cat]] on all fronts. Though Hikaru has decent stats, his recharge time massively drags down his usage below most other midrangers, including the aforementioned Kung Fu as well as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] and [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Actress Cat]]. Even [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]'s superior stats and useful tankiness put Hikaru's usability in [[Empire of Cats]] into question, the only place Hikaru could even hypothetically be useful.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

